                                                "sense_id": "4e7cac44-3ddc-3c94-86d6-6c5dc911e5b7",
                                                "text": "We'd smoked some nice sticky that night and fucked with some Erk and Jerk too, so my head was still cloudy when Pimp came in the room and said get up."
